<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Light Q1 net 81.173 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Light Q1 net 81.173 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian private power distributor Light sent the following statement to local stock exchanges on its first quarter results.</p>
<p>			    Q1 1997</p>
<p>    Shr net	     0.00781 reais</p>
<p>    Net profit	  81.173 million</p>
<p>    Operating revs   125.261 million</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in Brazilian reais, not adjusted for inflation. No comparative data provided.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
